 * under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions; ROSE's changes are contributed under
 * the same terms.
 *
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
 *
 * At build time this file is concatenated with the output of EDG's dettarg utility (the
 * host/target description) into cmake_defines.h, which EDG's src/defines.h includes when
 * USE_CMAKE_DEFINES is defined.  See Makefile.am / CMakeLists.txt in this directory.
 */
/*

defines.h -- Defines configuration parameters for a given version of the
             front end.

This is the version for ROSE Compiler. It is meant to be used by Linux, MacOS, and Windows.
*/

